       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BOSCR9.
      * BENEFICIAL OWNER SCREEN - HOLDING OR VOTING ABOVE THRESHOLD
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HOLDING-PCT            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-VOTING-PCT             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-BENEFICIAL             PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-HOLDING-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-VOTING-PCT
           PERFORM 2000-TEST-OWNER
           DISPLAY 'BO: ' WS-BENEFICIAL
           STOP RUN.
       2000-TEST-OWNER.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-BENEFICIAL
           IF WS-HOLDING-PCT > 10.00
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BENEFICIAL
           END-IF
           IF WS-VOTING-PCT > 10.00
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BENEFICIAL
           END-IF.
